# Regional Structure (SHORT)

Use regions for code folding + clarity.  
**Indent all region content 4 spaces.**  
**Close every region!**  
**No tabs.**

---

**JavaScript:**
```javascript
// #Region ------------------------------------------------
// BLOCK TYPE | Desc
// --------------------------------------------------------

    // Content (4-space indent)

// endregion ----------------------------------------------
```

**CSS:**
```css
/*  #Region ------------------------------------------------
 * BLOCK TYPE | Desc
 * -------------------------------------------------------- */

    /* CSS (4-space indent) */

/* endregion ---------------------------------------------- */
```

**HTML:**
```html
<!-- #Region ------------------------------------------ -->
<!-- BLOCK TYPE | Desc                                -->
<!-- ----------------------------------------------- -->

    <!-- Content/Components (4-space indent) -->

<!-- endregion ---------------------------------------- -->
```

**Block Types:**  
JS/CSS: MODULE, FUNCTION, CLASS, DATA, CONST, STATE, API, INIT  
HTML: REGION, UI HEADER, UI NAV, MAIN, SECTION, FOOTER, etc.

---

**Dash counts:**  
JS/CSS: open 60, section 56 (indented), close 50  
HTML: open 65, close 60

---
